# Credit Risk PD Modeling & Monitoring

This project demonstrates the full lifecycle of Probability of Default (PD) model development, validation, scorecard construction, and model monitoring.

## Project Scope

- Data cleaning and preprocessing
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Weight of Evidence (WOE) transformation
- Logistic regression modeling (sklearn & statsmodels)
- Model validation (AUC, KS, Gini)
- Score scaling and segmentation
- Population Stability Index (PSI) for monitoring

Note:
Loss Given Default (LGD) and Exposure at Default (EAD) modeling require recovery and exposure-level datasets and will be developed in a separate project.
